+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container privacy-content">
+    <h1>Your privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>You can browse these pages without providing personal information or creating an account.</p>
+    <h2>What these pages collect</h2>
+    <p>These static pages have no forms, analytics, advertising, tracking pixels, or client-side scripts. They do not set cookies or store information in your browser. We do not request your location, camera, or microphone.</p>
+    <h2>Images and other services</h2>
+    <p>Our styles and coffee photo are served from this website. Browsing these pages does not load content from image providers, social networks, or other third-party services.</p>
+    <h2>Delivering the website</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends connection information, including your IP address and the requested page, to the hosting provider to deliver the site. The provider may keep operational or security logs. Retention and access depend on the hosting configuration; this website does not control those logs through your browser.</p>
+    <h2>Accounts and orders</h2>
+    <p>This static website does not process accounts, payments, or orders. Any future service that collects personal information will need its own explanation of the information required, its purpose, retention, and available choices before collection begins.</p>
+    <h2>Your choices</h2>
+    <p>There are no optional tracking features to enable or disable on these pages. You can browse with JavaScript disabled. The site requests that browsers do not send referrer information when you follow links.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer>
+    <div class="footer-links"><a href="/">Home</a> | <a href="/privacy-policy/" aria-current="page">Privacy</a></div>
+    <p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co. All rights reserved.</p>
+  </footer>
+</body>
+</html>
